messages ({(["poster":"Bel","time":827947176,"body":"When I sell one item on one store,then other store at each place will have this item too ?Then I can't sell with good price !","title":"Bug of Store ?","id":800,]),(["poster":"Takeda","time":827978324,"body":"On Thu Mar 28, Bel wrote:> When I sell one item on one store,> then other store at each place will have this item too ?> Then I can't sell with good price !你不覺得這樣寫省很多mem 嗎^_^                              Sincerely your Takeda","title":"Re: Bug of Store ?","id":801,]),(["poster":"Elon","time":828003216,"title":"Re: Re: Bug of Store ?","body":"On Thu Mar 28, Takeda wrote:> On Thu Mar 28, Bel wrote:> > When I sell one item on one store,> > then other store at each place will have this item too ?> > Then I can't sell with good price !> 你不覺得這樣寫省很多mem 嗎^_^> >                               Sincerely your Takeda騙人.. 要說.. 因為ES 的商店是 7-Eleven 連鎖店.. 所以東西都賣一樣的-elon","id":802,]),(["poster":"Iris","time":828044012,"body":"嗨, 各位好:    交大傳科所有位同學正在進行mud 方面的研究,(ES目前這臺機器是用這個名目ㄠ來的 *grin*),有份問卷需要大家配合, 希望大家能認真回答。我把問卷放在ftp coral.cis.nctu.edu 8008 上, 請大家自己抓回去填寫後mail給maybo@coral.cis.nctu.edu.tw謝謝大家合作。				Iris","title":"問卷調查","id":803,]),(["poster":"Bel","time":828051908,"body":"很多新手發現 錢越來越難賺 日子越來越苦當大家都開始用奉獻的指令雖然立意很好 不過傷害性很大 由其是 sac all見議 在某些條件下 不能 toss and sac 也許也是防只 Pker 如 EQs 的等級 或 錢高於某值這篇是記念 perfumer 也許打錯名子在 我幫他 cast di and lt 後 被 殺 跟  Sac all eqs 及遇上 Lev 11 的新手騎士同時 不希望見到 Knight 又被各公會所恨畢竟 好裝備的 Knight 功擊防禦力 是無能所及的","title":"廢除 Sac command !","id":804,]),(["poster":"Hithieves","time":828125463,"title":"斷線","body":"請教各位...為什麼有人斷線可以維持很久?且年齡都不變?How to do that??","id":805,]),(["poster":"Arthur","time":828126198,"title":"< no title >","body":"bye bye all friends...要閉關了...這次是真的..:)finger 看看就知道:)等5月考完後再見.....Arthur","id":807,]),(["poster":"Elon","time":828160745,"title":"Re: Re: < no title >","body":"On Sat Mar 30, Bel wrote:> On Sat Mar 30, Arthur wrote:> > bye bye all friends...要閉關了...這次是真